    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/dc/Dima_Primordial_Warrior_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251121192346\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dima Primordial Warrior Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/dc/Dima_Primordial_Warrior_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251121192346\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"972\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Dima Primordial Warrior Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Dima_Primordial_Warrior_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>原始战士</b>\n</p><p>一位毁灭性的美丽战士，在只有强者才能生存的丛林中长大。\n拥有动物般的力量和速度，她轻松挥舞着她那把骨头做的斧头。\n她佩戴的头骨是她独自杀死的第一个长牙野兽的。\n\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/6f/Dima_Spc_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230817225411\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dima Spc Queen&#39;s blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/6f/Dima_Spc_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230817225411\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"835\" height=\"1696\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Dima Spc Queen&#39;s blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Dima_Spc_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/70/Dima_PW_Holiday_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251121192504\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dima PW Holiday Queen&#39;s Blade